# addWithOccurrences!

- _addWithOccurrences!(c, x, n)_

Add the object _x_ to the collection _c_ multiple times.
The operation is equivalent to adding _x_ to _c_ _n_ times using `add`.

```
>>> let l = [];
>>> l.addWithOccurrences!(3, 5);
>>> l
[3 3 3 3 3]
```

* * *

See also: add

